# AfterMath — Environment Variables

# Alibaba Cloud DashScope API Key for the optional Qwen 3.7 Plus explanation layer.
# Get your key at https://dashscope.console.aliyun.com/
#
# This is OPTIONAL. The app works fully without it.
# When absent, the deterministic explanation provider is used automatically.
# When present, qwen3.7-plus enhances explanations with natural-language summaries.
# If Qwen fails (timeout, invalid response, quota), the deterministic fallback is used.
#
# The key is NEVER exposed to the browser bundle.
# It is only used in the server-side API route: src/app/api/explain/route.ts
DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=
